Local correction: in modules/transformer.py RingKVCache.complete, use delta < 0
instead of delta <= 0. Once the cache fills, the slot at end_index holds the
oldest token, at end_offset - capacity, not a future token at end_offset.
This preserves full-context causal attention at wraparound and matches native
non-streaming teacher forcing, including the final depth-codebook step.
